# Documentation policy. NOTE: this repo is PUBLIC; the companion sicurre repo
# is private. That asymmetry is why this list is explicit rather than "docs/".
#
# Versioned - what someone who did not build this needs in order to work on it,
# and the evidence a reviewer reads. Audited: no credential, host, address, or
# personal data appears in any of them. They disclose the stack (Hetzner CX33,
# redis, Alloy) but nothing reachable.
#
# Kept local:
#   docs/ops/          runbooks - name storage buckets and recovery procedures
#   docs/report/       certification evidence
#   docs/simplon/      Simplon's referential - third-party material, not ours
#                      to publish - plus the assessment checklist
#   docs/experiments/  scratch
#   docs/progress-plan.md  internal planning, carries a personal address
!docs/
docs/*
!docs/README.md
!docs/adr/
!docs/api/
!docs/api/openapi.yaml
!docs/architecture/
!docs/model/
docs/ops/
docs/ops/**
docs/report/
docs/report/**
docs/simplon/
docs/simplon/**
docs/experiments/
docs/experiments/**
docs/progress-plan.md

*.png
